  "content": "\n\n<p>视频展示：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/75BsBGy94Ts?si=5W4tPmAU7tU-jc1a&start=7319\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>使用我的 Unstable SMP 整合包体验一下吧！</strong></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/manepear-rpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/manepear-rpg</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p>一款简单的资源包，全面重制了 Minecraft 原版 GUI，以 Unstable SMP 为主题。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e9543bd1-4774-446d-bef2-c1cbb736f7c2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"379\" height=\"350\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0cc105d1-ac1c-4786-8e6b-e87d86fab6e0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"373\" height=\"344\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_69531071-c881-4dde-927d-fc2af0c2f11f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"403\" height=\"373\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">我与 Unstable SMP 或其任何创作者均无关联。这只是一个粉丝项目。在此了解更多关于 Unstable 的信息：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252funstable-universe-mc.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fUnstable_Universe_Wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://unstable-universe-mc.fandom.com/wiki/Unstable_Universe_Wiki</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Unstable SMP 的主要角色：</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ParrotX2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/@ParrotX2</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@wemmbumc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/@wemmbumc</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@FlameFragsMC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/@FlameFragsMC</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Spokeishere\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/@Spokeishere</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p>该资源包仍在开发中。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/usKwxca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1438777/description_b73aa9d6-0dfe-4713-861d-1eb571c8288f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"180\"></a></p>",
